#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1446
msgid "ZapFast keeps your unreadable archive as a separate file, creates a new one, and asks you to link again. Linking again brings back recent history from your phone. Afterwards, remove the old ZapFast entry under Linked devices on your phone."
msgstr "ZapFast nyimpen arsip sing ora bisa diwaca minangka berkas kapisah, nggawe sing anyar, lan njaluk kowe nyambung maneh. Nyambung maneh bakal nggawa riwayat anyar saka HP-mu. Sawise kuwi, busak entri ZapFast lawas ing Piranti tertaut ing HP-mu."

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1450
msgid "If you can restore the original keyring instead, choose Cancel and Try again: nothing is lost that way."
msgstr "Yen kowe bisa mbalekake keyring asline, pilih Batal lan Coba maneh: ora ana sing ilang nganggo cara kuwi."

